        <item>
            <title>2.43.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 02:35:17 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>133</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.43.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- Files a mirrored session opens — whether the agent runs `open` or you click a file link in the mirror pane — now travel over the mirror connection itself instead of being copied back over ssh. The same 600 KB PDF that took about four seconds now opens in a quarter of one, and the host no longer needs ssh access to your Mac. A transfer that takes longer than a moment shows a progress overlay in the pane, with the file name, a bar, and the byte count; a failed transfer says so for a few seconds. Files still land in `~/Downloads/from-<host>/`.

### Changes
- SSH remote sessions keep sending files back over ssh, but now do it in one connection per file with the connection kept alive for a minute afterwards — about four seconds became one for the first file and half a second for the next.
]]></description>
